xv6-RISCV APP-LIFECYCLE OS
==========================

A phone-style app lifecycle built on top of xv6-riscv. Apps can be in the
foreground, in the background or suspended; a simulated battery drains over
time and throttles background apps; and a low-memory killer (LMK) frees
memory by killing the least important apps first.

Based on MIT's xv6-riscv (https://github.com/mit-pdos/xv6-riscv). The original
xv6 license applies to the base code (see LICENSE).


